  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · 
    
    
    intro q p_π hp_π
    rcases hp_π with
      ⟨hc_π, hr_π, hAdd_π, hLim_π, hColim_π, T_Yt, hT_Yt, T_Y, hT_Y, ιℤ_π, hιπ_π, hπι_π, hp_π_eq⟩
